    <label>ancestral phoenix blood</label>
    <description>Born of Danxue's pyre. The fire remembers you, and returns you to the world every time. Feng Mingluan burned nine times inside the Iron Calamity to kill it, and at this purity her fire has grown too calm to burn in anger.</description>
